Experiment 8: Deploy a Static Site Using a CI/CD Pipeline

1. Aim

To create and deploy a static website using GitHub Pages and automate the deployment process using GitHub Actions.

2. Requirements

1. A GitHub account.
2. An existing GitHub repository.
3. An internet connection.
4. A web browser.
5. Basic knowledge of HTML and GitHub Actions.

